THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS AND EXTERNAL MATERIAL

This MIT license applies to the original wmcleaner project source code in
this repository only. It does not extend to:

1. Third-party software and Python dependencies (NumPy, OpenCV, Pillow,
   Requests, BeautifulSoup, Selenium, PyTorch, simple-lama-inpainting,
   IOPaint anime/manga LaMa weights, and others). These are distributed
   under their own licenses. Review each dependency's license before
   redistribution or commercial use.

2. Downloaded AI model weights. wmcleaner does not bundle LaMa or
   Anime-LaMa weights. The LaMa model and the anime/manga-finetuned
   weights are downloaded and cached locally at first use and remain
   subject to their upstream licenses and terms.

3. Source-site content. wmcleaner contains no comic, manhua or manga pages
   and no scraped chapter content. Source sites, their branding (including
   any publisher logos or marks referenced by detector templates) and
   their page images are NOT licensed or distributed under this project
   license. Users are responsible for respecting copyright and each site's
   terms of service.

4. Small detector reference assets under `wmcleaner/templates/`. These are
   minimal, low-resolution reference assets used only to locate watermark
   anchors. They are not intended to reproduce or represent publisher
   artwork, and no ownership of any publisher's branding is claimed.

WATERMARK REMOVAL NOTICE

wmcleaner is intended for cleaning watermarks from images that the user is
authorized to modify. It is not intended to strip attribution from, or
otherwise misappropriate, copyrighted works.
